Package: piano-userspace
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: liisoya <liisoya@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: kmod, systemd
Description: Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro (piano) userspace runtime pieces
 Device runtime scripts and data for piano mainline Linux:
 piano-* systemd services (adsp/audio/camera/cpufreq/display/keyboard/
 radio/swapfile/touch/usb/video), ALSA UCM2 for Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro,
 modprobe/modules-load/udev rules, piano-touch-view, piano-camerad
 and busybox. Consumed by the ubuntu-sheng-style chroot build.
